  "category": "representation",
  "description": "A string column becomes large_string (64-bit offsets). Values are unchanged; they include an empty string, whitespace, the literal text NULL, CJK, an emoji, and 'cafe' with the accent both composed (U+00E9) and decomposed (e + U+0301).",
